id: youtube-feed-no-preview
section: Sites
item: YouTube's home feed starts no video by itself: 30 s on the feed untouched and after a pan, no video element plays (the mobile feed has none; the gate of jihad.youtube.stopAutoplay would refuse one)
shells: enyo
page: https://m.youtube.com/
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true
kit: cavekit-device-headroom.md R4
needs: internet
# the card is launched on the feed and its load awaited by the runner: no load mark comes after the script's own mark
wait quiet 'play() allowed' 30
probe feed '(function(){var vs=document.querySelectorAll("video"),p=0;for(var i=0;i<vs.length;i++)if(!vs[i].paused)p++;return "videos "+vs.length+" playing "+p+" images "+document.images.length;})()'
expect probe-has 'playing 0'
drag 384 800 384 300 600
wait settled 8
wait quiet 'play() allowed' 10
probe feed-after-a-pan '(function(){var vs=document.querySelectorAll("video"),p=0;for(var i=0;i<vs.length;i++)if(!vs[i].paused)p++;return "videos "+vs.length+" playing "+p;})()'
expect probe-has 'playing 0'
